Z||000009||Jeff Blowers||10-19-2001||08:26 PM||||I just got a carpet kit from the Fiero Store for $140.  Fit perfectly, and seems like pretty good quality.  Did not include door pieces but I think you can order them separately if you need them.||||reg||1
Z||000010||Monkeyman||10-19-2001||09:23 PM||||I have LT1ChopTops other set of black ACC carpeting.  I love it.  The only thing I don't like is the fact that it's not as sturdy as the original.  Not that it isn't holding up well, but the original carpet could hold up the car.  It seemed to have been built with a hard plastic backing.  The ACC carpet doesn't really have a backing (just a little bit of insulation in one area.  Still, I'd buy ACC again if I had to replace this set.||||reg||1
